#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_project_suspension_follow_up
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"      <br/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"  </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"project\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"suspension\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"date1\" t-value=\"suspension.create_date\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"type\" t-value=\"suspension.type\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"suspended\" t-value=\"suspension.type == &#x27;Suspension&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reasons\" t-value=\"suspension.suspension_reason_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"details\" t-value=\"suspension.suspension_detail\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine_patenkinder, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"suspension.type == &#x27;Reactivation&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"date2\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[1].create_date\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"date2\" t-value=\"date1\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"date1\" t-value=\"datetime.date.today()\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"months\" t-value=\"(date1.year - date2.year) * 12 + (date1.month - date2.month)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"suspended\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Siamo spiacenti di informarti che le indagini sul centro di sviluppo di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> sono ancora in corso. Tuttavia, questo ci conferma che gli standard di qualità internazionali a cui Compassion aderisce sono presi sul serio e vengono applicati.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Siamo lieti di informarti che, a seguito delle indagini, i chiarimenti relativi al centro di sviluppo infantile di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> sono stati completati e che tutte le attività sono state riprese.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"    Desideriamo ringraziarti di cuore per la fiducia e il prezioso sostegno durante il periodo di sospensione del servizio.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Le tue donazioni non hanno potuto essere inviate per <t t-out=\"months\"></t> mesi. Se desideri un rimborso, ti preghiamo di comunicarci le tue coordinate bancarie.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"suspended\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Per il resto del periodo di sospensione del servizio, ti suggeriamo di interrompere il tuo ordine permanente o di trasferire le donazioni al nostro fondo per i bambini senza sostenitore.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        In alternativa, ti suggeriamo di trasferire le donazioni al nostro fondo per i bambini senza sostenitore.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ti ringraziamo in anticipo per il tuo feedback nelle prossime settimane.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"suspended\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Continueremo a tenerti informato/a sugli sviluppi.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cordiali saluti<br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_parent_alive
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"role\" t-value=\"&#x27;mother&#x27; if child.household_id.revised_value_ids.name == &#x27;Natural Mother Alive&#x27; else &#x27;father&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"status\" t-value=\"&#x27;alive&#x27; if child.household_id.revised_value_ids.get_field_value() == &#x27;True&#x27; else &#x27;dead&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"child.firstname\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    We have been notified from our local employees that the <t t-out=\"role\"></t> of your sponsored child has passed away. If you would like to write a few lines expressing your condolences to comfort <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>, this can be easily done via your <a href=\"https://www.compassion.ch\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\">MyCompassion</a> profile.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    In this difficult time, your support for <t t-out=\"child.firstname\"></t> makes an even bigger difference.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together we can positively transform the lives of currently more than <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> million children in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    With kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"female\" t-value=\"child.household_id.revised_value_ids.name == &#x27;Natural Mother Alive&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"role\" t-value=\"&#x27;la mamma&#x27; if female else &#x27;il papà&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reason\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"lifecycle\" t-as=\"l\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"l.request_reason == &#x27;death of caregiver&#x27;\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"l.comments\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"reason\" t-value=\"l.translate(&#x27;comments&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie di cuore per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> tramite il sostegno.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    L'ufficio nazionale ci informa che <t t-out=\"role\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;del bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;della bambina&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t> è decedut<t t-out=\"&#x27;a&#x27; if female else &#x27;o&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"reason\">\n"
"        Secondo il centro di accoglienza, <t t-out=\"reason\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Se <t t-out=\"&#x27;desiderate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;desideri&#x27;\"></t> scrivere a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> per avere sue notizie e offrir<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> parole di conforto, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> farlo direttamente online su <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/scrivere/\">compassion.ch/it/scrivere/</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In questo momento di prova, il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> è ancora più prezioso.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_birthdate
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"child.firstname\"></t>. In situations of extreme poverty, sometimes data is not recorded correctly. This is the case with your sponsored child. We were informed that your sponsored child was not born on <t t-out=\"child.get_date(&#x27;old_birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t> but on <t t-out=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support of a child in extreme poverty is valuable.  At Compassion, we believe that this will give a child the opportunity to live a purposeful life. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you again for your commitment so that together we can positively change the lives of currently more than 1.9 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"       <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"        </p>\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> attraverso il sostegno.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            In situazioni di estrema povertà, a volte non è possibile registrare correttamente i dati dei bambini. Può capitare che alcuni non abbiano un certificato di nascita.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Abbiamo saputo che la data di nascita <t t-out=\"&#x27;del bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;della bambina&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t> è stata registrata in modo errato. <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> non è nat<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> il <t t-out=\"child.get_date(&#x27;old_birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t>, ma il <t t-out=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                 Il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno a un bambino che vive in condizioni di estrema povertà è prezioso. Noi di Compassion sappiamo che <t t-out=\"&#x27;state&#x27; if plural else &#x27;stai&#x27;\"></t> contribuendo a dare a un bambino una vita dignitosa e piena di senso.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Cari saluti,\n"
"            </p>\n"
"\n"
"            <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Buona giornata e a presto!\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_gender
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"child.firstname\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   In circumstances of extreme poverty, sometimes data is not collected correctly. This is the case with your sponsored child. We have been informed that <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> was introduced to you as a <t t-out=\"&#x27;boy&#x27; if child.old_values == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;girl&#x27;\"></t> even though<t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> is a <t t-out=\"&#x27;boy&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;girl&#x27;\"></t>. We thank you in advance for your understanding.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support of a child in extreme poverty is valuable. At Compassion, we believe this will give a child the chance to live with purpose. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your committment so that together we can positively transform the lives of currently 2 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your sincerely,\n"
"   <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"     <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.preferred_name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"boy\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"o\" t-value=\"&#x27;o&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"new_gender\" t-value=\"&#x27;un bambino&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"old_gender\" t-value=\"&#x27;una bambina&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"o\" t-value=\"&#x27;a&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"old_gender\" t-value=\"&#x27;un bambino&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"new_gender\" t-value=\"&#x27;una bambina&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"send_mode == &#x27;sms&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        In situazioni di estrema povertà, i dati relativi ai bambini potrebbero non essere stati registrati correttamente. Questo è il caso <t t-out=\"&#x27;del bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;della bambina&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t>. Abbiamo saputo che <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> è stat<t t-out=\"o\"></t> presentat<t t-out=\"o\"></t> come <t t-out=\"old_gender\"></t>, invece si tratta di <t t-out=\"new_gender\"></t>. Ci scusiamo per questo.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie per il tuo prezioso sostegno.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Buona giornata e a presto!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Il team di Compassion\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> attraverso il sostegno.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        In situazioni di estrema povertà, i dati relativi ai bambini potrebbero non essere stati registrati correttamente. Questo è il caso <t t-out=\"&#x27;del bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;della bambina&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t>. Abbiamo saputo che <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> è stat<t t-out=\"o\"></t> presentat<t t-out=\"o\"></t> come <t t-out=\"old_gender\"></t>, invece si tratta di <t t-out=\"new_gender\"></t>. Ci scusiamo per questo.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Più di <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza ci permettono di affermare che il sostegno trasforma non solo la vita di un bambino, ma anche quella della sua famiglia. Grazie per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> contributo.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Cari saluti,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_multiple_changes
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;old_firstname&#x27;)\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   The situation of your sponsored child has changed. We received the following message from the project where <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;old_firstname&#x27;)\"></t> is attending.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support of a child in extreme poverty is valuable. At Compassion we believe that this will give a child the chance to live a purposeful life. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together we can transform the lives of currently 2 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your sincerely,  \n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"      <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;sms&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Il centro di sviluppo infantile in cui è iscritt<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> ci informa che la sua situazione è cambiata:\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"child.mapped(&#x27;revised_value_ids&#x27;) + child.mapped(&#x27;household_id.revised_value_ids&#x27;)\" t-as=\"revision\">\n"
"            <li>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"revision.name\"></t> : <t t-out=\"revision.old_value\"></t> -&gt; <t t-out=\"revision.get_field_value()\"></t>\n"
"            </li>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Cari saluti e a presto,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie di cuore per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> tramite il sostegno.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Il centro di sviluppo infantile in cui è iscritt<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> ci informa che la sua situazione è cambiata:\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"child.mapped(&#x27;revised_value_ids&#x27;) + child.mapped(&#x27;household_id.revised_value_ids&#x27;)\" t-as=\"revision\">\n"
"            <li>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"revision.name\"></t> : <t t-out=\"revision.old_value\"></t> -&gt; <t t-out=\"revision.get_field_value()\"></t>\n"
"            </li>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Più di <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza ci permettono di affermare che un sostegno può cambiare non solo la vita di un bambino, ma anche quella della sua famiglia. Grazie per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> impegno al nostro fianco.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Cari saluti e a presto,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_name
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"child.old_firstname\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   In extreme poverty situations, data may not be collected correctly or the family situation may change.  This is the case with your sponsored child.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   From now on, you can call your sponsored child,\n"
"   <b style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>\n"
"   </b>\n"
"   in your next letter.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support of a child in extreme poverty is valuable. At Compassion, we believe this will give a child the opportunity to live a purposeful life. <t t-out=\"&#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together we can positively transform the lives of currently more than 2 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your sincerly,   \n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"      <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p><t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;sms&#x27;\">\n"
"        </p><p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"child.old_firstname\"></t> attraverso il sostegno.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            In situazioni di estrema povertà, potrebbe non essere possibile registrare correttamente i dati dei bambini o potrebbe accadere che la loro situazione familiare cambi. Questo è il caso <t t-out=\"&#x27;del bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;della bambina&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t> il cui nome non è stato inserito correttamente. Ci dispiace per questo.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            In futuro, <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> preghiamo di chiamare <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;il bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;la bambina&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno a un bambino che vive in condizioni di estrema povertà è prezioso. Noi di Compassion sappiamo che <t t-out=\"&#x27;state&#x27; if plural else &#x27;stai&#x27;\"></t> contribuendo a dare a un bambino una vita dignitosa e significativa. Grazie di cuore.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Cari saluti e a presto,\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            In situazioni di estrema povertà, a volte i dati non vengono registrati correttamente. Quando <t t-out=\"&#x27;il bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;la bambina&#x27;\"></t> che sostieni è stat<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> ammess<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> al centro di sviluppo infantile, il suo nome è stato registrato in modo errato. Ci dispiace per l'inconveniente!\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            D'ora in poi potrai chiamar<t t-out=\"&#x27;lo&#x27; if boy else &#x27;la&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Grazie per il tuo prezioso supporto.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Buona giornata e a presto!\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p><t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t></p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_disability
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   In Switzerand and also in the country where your sponsored child lives, there are health problems despite medical precautions and examinations. We have been informed by the local staff that <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> has contracted <t t-out=\"child.current_values\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thanks to your support and a special fund for medical emergencies, Compassion is able to look after the health problems of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>. Thank you for accompanying <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> in prayer.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support for a child in extreme poverty is valuable. At Compassion, we believe this will give a child the chance to live a dignified and meaningful life. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together we can positively transform the lives of over 1.9 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sincerely,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"      <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p><t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"illness\" t-value=\"child.current_values\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"        </p><p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> attraverso il sostegno.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Purtroppo <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> contattiamo per <t t-out=\"&#x27;darvi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;darti&#x27;\"></t> una triste notizia: il centro di sviluppo infantile ci ha informato che <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> è affett<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> da <t t-out=\"illness\"></t>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Grazie al <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno e a uno speciale fondo medico, Compassion si impegna a monitorare e curare i problemi di salute di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> chiediamo di pregare per la sua protezione e la sua salute.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno a un bambino che vive in estrema povertà è prezioso. A Compassion sappiamo che <t t-out=\"&#x27;state&#x27; if plural else &#x27;stai&#x27;\"></t> contribuendo a dare a un bambino una vita dignitosa e piena di senso. Grazie!\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>Cari saluti,</p>\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Purtroppo <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> contattiamo per <t t-out=\"&#x27;darvi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;darti&#x27;\"></t> una triste notizia: il centro di sviluppo infantile ci ha informato che <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> è affetto da <t t-out=\"illness\"></t>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Grazie al <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno e a uno speciale fondo medico, Compassion si impegna a monitorare e curare i problemi di salute di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> chiediamo di pregare per la sua protezione e la sua salute.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Buona giornata e a presto!\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_sponsorship_cancellation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;many children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We took note of the cancellation of your sponsorship toward <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you so much for having sponsored <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;this child&#x27;)\"></t>!                    Thanks to your sponsorship, <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> could participate in all the activities offered by the Compassion child project:                    food, clothes, academic support, health screenings and treatments, Bible studies, games, field trips, birthday and Christmas gifts and a lot more.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We will now look for a new sponsor to continue the follow up with <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   With our best regards,\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuoi_bambini\" t-value=\"&#x27;vostri bambini&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuoi bambini&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(children) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"one_child and children.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, tuoi_bambini, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"nb_weeks\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 7\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"nb_years\" t-value=\"(sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 364) or 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field\" t-value=\"children[:1].field_office_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"field.fcp_hours_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"meals\" t-value=\"field.fcp_meal_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"medical\" t-value=\"field.fcp_medical_check * nb_years\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(str(hours_fcp)) &gt; 3\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"str((hours_fcp))\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"hours_fcp[:-3] + &#x27;.&#x27; + hours_fcp[-3:]\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"7 in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;end_reason_id&quot;).ids or 9 in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;end_reason_id&quot;).ids\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Hai&#x27;\"></t> scelto di sostenere <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> per aiutar<t t-out=\"&#x27;lo&#x27; if boy else &#x27;la&#x27;\"></t> a uscire dalla povertà estrema. Questo impegno non è stato confermato dal pagamento concordato.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;VI&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> comunichiamo pertanto che il sostegno è stato annullato.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Con la presente confermiamo la fine del sostegno di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Durante il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> ha trascorso <t t-out=\"hours_fcp\"></t> ore presso il centro di sviluppo infantile della chiesa locale. Il personale si è preso cura di <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t> con amore, trasmettendo<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> speranza per il futuro. Ha ricevuto <t t-out=\"meals\"></t> pasti e beneficiato di <t t-out=\"medical\"></t> visite mediche.\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"min(children.mapped(&#x27;age&#x27;)) &gt;= 7\">\n"
"            Ha potuto inoltre frequentare la scuola ed essere incoraggiat<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> a sviluppare i propri talenti. Infine, ha scoperto che qualcuno dall'altra parte del mondo si preoccupava per <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t>. Grazie di cuore!\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Compassion Svizzera cercherà un sostenitore affinché <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> possa beneficiare del sostegno e delle attività del centro infantile, per vivere una vita dignitosa e piena di senso.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<!-- CSP -->\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Il sostegno dei bambini è solo uno dei numerosi programmi di Compassion per liberare ogni giorno più bambini dalla povertà estrema. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Conoscete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Conosci&#x27;\"></t> il programma di sopravvivenza per le donne incinte e le mamme di neonati? Con una donazione una tantum o regolare, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> fare davvero la differenza garantendo loro: accesso alle cure mediche durante la gravidanza, assistenza al parto in una struttura medica, formazione genitoriale, supporto psicologico, sociale e spirituale, aiuto materiale e formazione per generare reddito.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Con soli 15 CHF <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> sostenere una donna e il suo bambino per un'intera settimana. Non <t t-out=\"&#x27;esitate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esitare&#x27;\"></t> a contattarci o, se lo <t t-out=\"&#x27;desiderate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;desideri&#x27;\"></t>, a fare una donazione qui:\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/sopravvivenza/\">compassion.ch/it/sopravvivenza</a>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        compassion.ch/it/sopravvivenza\n"
"    </t>\n"
"     per continuare a contribuire alla lotta contro la povertà estrema.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<!-- WASH -->\n"
"<!--\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Sapevate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Sapevi&#x27;\"></t> che quasi 4 persone su 10 nel mondo non hanno accesso a una toilette sicura? A causa di questa situazione e dell'acqua contaminata, i bambini spesso si ammalano e non possono andare a scuola. Compassion costruisce e ristruttura servizi igienici e fornisce ai bambini e alle famiglie una formazione sull'igiene per proteggere la loro salute e favorire il loro sviluppo.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Con una donazione unica o regolare di 30 CHF, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> garantire a un bambino l'accesso a servizi igienici sicuri e fare una differenza significativa nella sua vita. Non <t t-out=\"&#x27;esitate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esitare&#x27;\"></t> a contattarci o, se lo <t t-out=\"&#x27;desiderate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;desideri&#x27;\"></t>, a fare una donazione qui\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/donare/\">compassion.ch/it/donare/</a>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        compassion.ch/it/donare/\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"-->\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Saremo felici di <t t-out=\"&#x27;avervi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;averti&#x27;\"></t> al nostro fianco in futuro nella lotta contro la povertà estrema.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_project_suspension
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"project\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"suspension\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reasons\" t-value=\"suspension.suspension_reason_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"details\" t-value=\"suspension.suspension_detail\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine_patenkinder, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for investing in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;lives&#x27; if len(child) &gt; 1 else &#x27;life&#x27;\"></t> of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Compassion works with <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> partner churches in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries, which work according to international quality standards and are regularly inspected.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Today we would like to inform you that the child development center that <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> attends is currently suspended because quality standards are not met. Various investigations are underway. Compassion staff are offering the partner church support and training to resolve the issues.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Specifically, this means that your donations / part of your donations for <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> will be withheld until the child development center can fully resume all activities.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"suspension.hold_gifts and suspension.hold_s2b_letters\">\n"
"        Unfortunately, neither gifts nor letters can be sent.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"suspension.hold_gifts and not suspension.hold_s2b_letters\">\n"
"        We are pleased that gifts and letters can still be sent.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"not suspension.hold_gifts and suspension.hold_s2b_letters\">\n"
"        We are pleased that letters can still be sent. However, it is currently not possible to send gifts.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        We are pleased that gifts can still be sent. However, it is not possible to forward letters at the moment.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We will inform you about the further process and any need for action over the next two months.\n"
"</p>    \n"
"<p>\n"
"    If you have any further questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"project\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"suspension\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reasons\" t-value=\"suspension.suspension_reason_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"details\" t-value=\"suspension.suspension_detail\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine_patenkinder, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"informato\" t-value=\"&#x27;informato&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"informato\" t-value=\"&#x27;informata&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> ringraziamo di cuore per il tuo prezioso contributo al miglioramento della vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Compassion lavora con <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Paesi, che operano secondo standard di qualità internazionali e sono regolarmente monitorate.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Oggi desideriamo informarti che il servizio del centro di sviluppo frequentato da <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> è attualmente sospeso. Sono in corso diverse indagini, perché il Centro di sviluppo infantile non funziona attualmente secondo i principi e le politiche di funzionamento concordati e applicati da Compassion. Il personale di Compassion sta fornendo al partner ecclesiastico supporto e formazione per affrontare questo problema.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"suspension.hold_gifts and suspension.hold_s2b_letters\">\n"
"        Purtroppo non è possibile inviare regali o lettere.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"suspension.hold_gifts and not suspension.hold_s2b_letters\">\n"
"        Siamo lieti che sia possibile continuare a inviare regali e lettere.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"not suspension.hold_gifts and suspension.hold_s2b_letters\">\n"
"        Siamo lieti che sia possibile continuare a inoltrare lettere. Tuttavia, al momento non è possibile inviare regali.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Siamo lieti che sia possibile continuare a inviare regali. Tuttavia, al momento non è possibile inoltrare lettere.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nei prossimi due mesi <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> terremo <t t-out=\"informato\"></t> sugli sviluppi e sulle eventuali misure da adottare.\n"
"</p>    \n"
"<p>\n"
"    Non esitare a contattarci per qualsiasi altra domanda.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cordiali saluti\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_disaster_alert
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;Your sponsored children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname_n\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Firstname_n\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;Your sponsored children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"disaster\" t-value=\"children.mapped(&#x27;child_disaster_impact_ids.disaster_id&#x27;)[:1].with_context(lang=&#x27;en_US&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"healthy\" t-value=\"children.mapped(&#x27;child_disaster_impact_ids&#x27;)[:1].beneficiary_physical_condition == &#x27;Beneficiary Healthy&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"house_damaged\" t-value=\"children.mapped(&#x27;child_disaster_impact_ids&#x27;)[:1].house_condition != &#x27;Not Damaged&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sms\" t-value=\"object.send_mode == &quot;sms&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We have been informed that a natural disaster has struck the region where <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> lives.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"healthy\">\n"
"    Luckily, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> is well.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    Unfortunately, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> has been hurt.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;).title()\"></t>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"house_damaged\">\n"
"    house is damaged and <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> has lost all <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> household items, clothes and school supplies.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    house was not damaged.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You may want to write some lines to comfort <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    This can easily be done via your <a href=\"https://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a> profile.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You can also make a donation to <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> and <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family in these difficult circumstances using the attached payment slip.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Especially in exceptional situations such as this one, your support makes a big difference. Thank you!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"\t<p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t></p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"disaster\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;child_disaster_impact_ids.disaster_id&#x27;)[:1].with_context(lang=&#x27;en_US&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Firstname\" t-value=\"firstname[0].upper() + firstname[1:]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"healthy\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;child_disaster_impact_ids&#x27;)[:1].beneficiary_physical_condition == &#x27;Beneficiary Healthy&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"house_damaged\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;child_disaster_impact_ids&#x27;)[:1].house_condition != &#x27;Not Damaged&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&#x27;vi&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"vuoi\" t-value=\"&#x27;volete&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"puoi\" t-value=\"&#x27;potete&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&#x27;ti&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&#x27;tuo&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"vuoi\" t-value=\"&#x27;vuoi&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"puoi\" t-value=\"&#x27;puoi&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;sms&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie di cuore per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> tramite il sostegno.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Con la presente <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> informiamo che una catastrofe naturale si è abbattuta sulla regione in cui vive <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"healthy\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"house_damaged\">\n"
"                è in buona salute, ma la sua casa è stata distrutta e <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t> ha perso tutti i suoi oggetti domestici, i suoi vestiti e il materiale scolastico.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                è in buona salute e la sua casa è intatta.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"house_damaged\">\n"
"                è ferit<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t>, la sua casa è stata distrutta e <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t> e ha perso tutti i suoi oggetti domestici, i suoi vestiti e il materiale scolastico.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                è ferit<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t>, ma la sua casa è intatta.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"vuoi.title()\"></t> scriver<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> una lettera di conforto? <t t-out=\"puoi.title()\"></t> farlo direttamente qui:\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"            <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/scrivere/\">compassion.ch/it/scrivere</a>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            compassion.ch/it/scrivere.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"puoi.title()\"></t> anche offrire un sostegno speciale in questo momento di difficoltà facendo una donazione alla sua famiglia direttamente online o tramite il bollettino allegato.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nella situazione difficile che sta attraversando, il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno è particolarmente prezioso.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Cari saluti e a presto,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Abbiamo saputo che una catastrofe naturale ha colpito la regione in cui vive <t t-out=\"&#x27;il bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;la bambina&#x27;\"></t> che sostieni. <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;è in buona salute&#x27; if healthy else (&#x27;è ferito&#x27; if boy else &#x27;è ferita&#x27;)\"></t>, ma <t t-out=\"&#x27;la sua casa è stata distrutta&#x27; if house_damaged else &#x27;la sua casa è intatta&#x27;\"></t> e <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t> ha perso tutti i suoi oggetti domestici, i suoi vestiti e il materiale scolastico.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Vuoi scriver<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> per confortarl<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t>? Puoi farlo su <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/scrivere/\">compassion.ch/it/scrivere</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie per le tue preghiere per <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> in questa difficile situazione.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_child_unplanned_exit
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"nb_weeks\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 7\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"nb_years\" t-value=\"(sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 364) or 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field\" t-value=\"child[:1].field_office_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"field.fcp_hours_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"meals\" t-value=\"field.fcp_meal_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"medical\" t-value=\"field.fcp_medical_check * nb_years\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"meals == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lunch\" t-value=\"&#x27;meal&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lunch\" t-value=\"&#x27;meals&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"medical == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"checkup\" t-value=\"&#x27;medical checkup&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"checkup\" t-value=\"&#x27;medical checkups&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;)[:1]\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"good_reason\" t-value=\"lifecycle.with_context(lang=&quot;en_US&quot;).request_reason in (&quot;beneficiary pursuing career opportunity&quot;, &quot;conflicts with school or work schedule&quot;, &quot;family circumstances have changed positively so that child no longer needs compassion&#x27;s assistance&quot;, &quot;no longer needs our assistance&quot;)\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"last_letter\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].child_letter_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"good_reason\">\n"
"    We have good news!\n"
"    <br/><br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"name\"></t> will come to the end of <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> sponsored journey early, because <t t-out=\"lifecycle.translate(&#x27;request_reason&#x27;)\"></t>. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;His&#x27;).title()\"></t> goal is to <t t-out=\"lifecycle.get_list(&#x27;future_hope_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t>. Isn't that great?\n"
"    <br/><br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;His&#x27;).title()\"></t> life was positively changed thanks to your support.\n"
"    <br/><br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"name\"></t> spent a total of <t t-out=\"hours_fcp\"></t> hours at the child centre of the local church. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;He&#x27;)\"></t> received <t t-out=\"meals\"></t> <t t-out=\"lunch\"></t> and went through <t t-out=\"medical\"></t> <t t-out=\"checkup\"></t>. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;He&#x27;).title()\"></t> was able to go to school regularly, was encouraged individually and knew that someone on the other side of the world was looking after <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>. <b>Thank you so much!</b>\n"
"    <br/><br/>\n"
"    We understand that this news might come as a surprise to you, but we hope that you will still be able to rejoice with us. \n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    We have received unexpected news from our staff <t t-out=\"field.country_id.in_preposition\"></t> <t t-out=\"field.country_id.name\"></t>. <t t-out=\"name\"></t> will come to the end of <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> sponsored journey early, because <t t-out=\"lifecycle.translate(&#x27;request_reason&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    <br/><br/>\n"
"    We understand that this news might come as a surprise to you. In circumstances of extreme poverty, the life situation sometimes changes in ways that we are not accustomed to. We are very sorry that your sponsorship with <t t-out=\"name\"></t> has abruptly ended.\n"
"    <br/><br/>\n"
"    That is why we would like to thank you all the more for your precious support. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;He&#x27;).title()\"></t> received <t t-out=\"meals\"></t> <t t-out=\"lunch\"></t> and went through <t t-out=\"medical\"></t> <t t-out=\"checkup\"></t>. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;He&#x27;).title()\"></t> was able to go to school regularly, was encouraged individually and knew that someone on the other side of the world was looking after <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;).title()\"></t>. Your investment will continue to impact and inspire <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family. <b>Thank you so much!</b>\n"
"    <br/><br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"name\"></t> is doing well. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;His&#x27;).title()\"></t> goal is to <t t-out=\"lifecycle.get_list(&#x27;future_hope_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t>. Isn't that great?\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\">\n"
"    <t t-if=\"2 in last_letter.communication_type_ids.ids and not last_letter.sent_date\">\n"
"        This moment becomes even more emotional, as attached you will find <t t-out=\"name\"></t>'s final correspondence. You are welcome to write a final farewell letter to <t t-out=\"name\"></t> to encourage <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> for the future.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for changing the life of a child and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family in a sustainable way!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Together, we are changing the world! One child at a time.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Best regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Our fight against extreme poverty continues! 385 million children still live in unacceptable conditions. 14000 children under the age of five die every day. We seek to tackle this urgency. With this in mind, we will soon suggest another child for you to sponsor.\n"
"</p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"nb_weeks\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 7\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"nb_years\" t-value=\"(sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 364) or 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field\" t-value=\"child[:1].field_office_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"field.fcp_hours_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"meals\" t-value=\"field.fcp_meal_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"medical\" t-value=\"field.fcp_medical_check * nb_years\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(str(hours_fcp)) &gt; 3\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"str((hours_fcp))\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"hours_fcp[:-3] + &#x27;.&#x27; + hours_fcp[-3:]\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lui\" t-value=\"&#x27;lui&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"gli\" t-value=\"&#x27;gli&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"o\" t-value=\"&#x27;o&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lo\" t-value=\"&#x27;lo&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"un\" t-value=\"&#x27;un&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"bambino\" t-value=\"&#x27;bambino&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lui\" t-value=\"&#x27;lei&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"gli\" t-value=\"&#x27;le&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"o\" t-value=\"&#x27;a&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lo\" t-value=\"&#x27;la&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"un\" t-value=\"&#x27;una&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"bambino\" t-value=\"&#x27;bambina&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&#x27;vi&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&#x27;voi&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&#x27;voi&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hai\" t-value=\"&#x27;avete&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&#x27;tuo&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&#x27;ti&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&#x27;te&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&#x27;tu&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hai\" t-value=\"&#x27;hai&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;)[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"good_reason\" t-value=\"lifecycle.with_context(lang=&quot;en_US&quot;).request_reason in (&quot;beneficiary pursuing career opportunity&quot;, &quot;conflicts with school or work schedule&quot;, &quot;family circumstances have changed positively so that child no longer needs compassion&#x27;s assistance&quot;, &quot;no longer needs our assistance&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reason\" t-value=\"lifecycle.translate(&#x27;request_reason&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"&#x27;Name&#x27; in reason\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"reason\" t-value=\"(reason).replace(&#x27;Name&#x27;, name)\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"last_letter\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].child_letter_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_deaths_under_5\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_deaths_under_5&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"age_deaths_under_5\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;age_deaths_under_5&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"good_reason\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Il sostegno di <t t-out=\"name\"></t> termina in anticipo, <t t-out=\"reason\"></t>. Non è una bella notizia!?\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Durante il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> ha trascorso <t t-out=\"hours_fcp\"></t> ore presso il centro di sviluppo infantile della chiesa locale. Il personale si è preso cura di <t t-out=\"lui\"></t> con amore, trasmettendo<t t-out=\"gli\"></t> speranza per il futuro. Ha ricevuto <t t-out=\"meals\"></t> pasti e beneficiato di <t t-out=\"medical\"></t> visite mediche.\n"
"        <t t-if=\"child.age &gt;= 7\">\n"
"            Ha potuto inoltre frequentare la scuola ed essere incoraggiat<t t-out=\"o\"></t> a sviluppare i propri talenti. Infine, ha scoperto che qualcuno dall'altra parte del mondo si preoccupava per <t t-out=\"lui\"></t>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        Grazie di cuore!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Ci rendiamo conto che questa notizia potrebbe coglier<t t-out=\"ti\"></t> di sorpresa, tuttavia ci auguriamo che sia fonte di gioia anche per <t t-out=\"te\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Siamo stati inaspettatamente informati dai colleghi <t t-out=\"field.country_id.in_preposition\"></t> <t t-out=\"field.country_id.name\"></t> che il sostegno di <t t-out=\"name\"></t> terminerà prima del previsto, <t t-out=\"reason\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Durante il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> ha trascorso <t t-out=\"hours_fcp\"></t> ore presso il centro di sviluppo infantile della chiesa locale. Il personale si è preso cura di <t t-out=\"lui\"></t> con amore, trasmettendo<t t-out=\"gli\"></t> speranza per il futuro. Ha ricevuto <t t-out=\"meals\"></t> pasti e beneficiato di <t t-out=\"medical\"></t> visite mediche.\n"
"        <t t-if=\"child.age &gt;= 7\">\n"
"            Ha potuto inoltre frequentare la scuola ed essere incoraggiat<t t-out=\"o\"></t> a sviluppare i propri talenti. Infine, ha scoperto che qualcuno dall'altra parte del mondo si preoccupava per <t t-out=\"lui\"></t>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        Grazie di cuore!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"name\"></t> sta bene. Il suo obiettivo nella vita è <t t-out=\"lifecycle.get_list(&#x27;future_hope_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t>. Non è meraviglioso?\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"2 in last_letter.communication_type_ids.ids and not last_letter.sent_date\">\n"
"            È per noi un momento emozionante, <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> inviamo in allegato la sua ultima lettera.\n"
"            <br/>\n"
"            Anche <t t-out=\"tu\"></t> <t t-out=\"hai\"></t> l'opportunità di scriver<t t-out=\"gli\"></t> un'ultima lettera per salutar<t t-out=\"lo\"></t> e incoraggiarl<t t-out=\"o\"></t> per il futuro.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"hai.title()\"></t> l'opportunità di scriver<t t-out=\"gli\"></t> un'ultima lettera per salutar<t t-out=\"lo\"></t> e incoraggiarl<t t-out=\"o\"></t> per il futuro.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per aver contribuito a un cambiamento duraturo nella vita di <t t-out=\"un\"></t> <t t-out=\"bambino\"></t> e della sua famiglia.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Il nostro impegno contro la povertà estrema continua, <t t-out=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\"></t> milioni di bambini vivono ancora in condizioni inaccettabili. Ogni giorno, muoiono <t t-out=\"number_deaths_under_5\"></t> bambini sotto i <t t-out=\"age_deaths_under_5\"></t> anni. Non possiamo restare inerti di fronte a questa ingiustizia, per questo motivo ci permettiamo di propor<t t-out=\"ti\"></t> a breve un nuovo sostegno.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Insieme, stiamo contribuendo a cambiare il mondo, un bambino alla volta.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_child_planned_exit
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your children&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                        \n"
"    <t t-if=\"one\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;) and child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sub\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;sub_sponsorship_id.child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    We sincerely thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. We have received joyful news from the child project: after many years of support from the staff at the local church and through you as the sponsor,\n"
"    <b><t t-out=\"name\"></t> is coming to the end of the sponsorship program and is a young adult.</b>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;).title()\"></t> looks with hope and trust to the future.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"one\">\n"
"    The local staff have told us that <t t-out=\"name\"></t>'s goals are to <t t-out=\"lifecycle.get_list(&#x27;future_hope_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"child\" t-as=\"one_child\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"one_child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;) and one_child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"        <li><t t-out=\"one_child.preferred_name\"></t>'s current goals are: <t t-out=\"lifecycle.get_list(&#x27;future_hope_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t>.</li>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</t>\n"
"Thanks to your regular support, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;was&#x27;)\"></t> able to go to school,  receive medical care and receive balanced meals and clothing. <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;).title()\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;was&#x27;)\"></t> also able to participate in activities that have helped <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> in <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> development - socially and spiritually. The family also benefitted from the support and participated in various activities organized by the center.\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\">\n"
"    You are welcome to send a last letter to <t t-out=\"name\"></t> and say goodbye to <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> and encourage <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> for the future. You can continue to accompany <t t-out=\"name\"></t> in prayer throughout <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> life.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"sub\">\n"
"    <t t-if=\"one\">\n"
"        As you know, the plight is enormous in the countries of the Global South. <t t-out=\"sub.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"sub.project_id.country_id.preposition\"></t> <t t-out=\"sub.project_id.country_id.name\"></t> lives in extreme poverty. Would you be ready to sponsor <t t-out=\"sub.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>? We will send you the information for <t t-out=\"sub.preferred_name\"></t> within 15 days to start the new sponsorship. If you would like to support a child in another country, have questions, or would like to cancel a sponsorship, please do not hesitate to contact us. We can be reached by phone at 031 552 21 25 or by e-mail at: info@compassion.ch \n"
"\t</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        As you already know, the plight of children living in poverty is enormous.  For instance, <t t-out=\"sub[0].preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"sub.project_id.country_id.name\"></t> <t t-out=\"sub[0].project_id.country_id.name\"></t> is one of them.  Would you consider and be ready to sponsor <t t-out=\"sub.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>?  We would like to send you information about <t t-out=\"sub[0].preferred_name\"></t> and other children in need within 15 days to begin new sponsorships. However, if you have questions, concerns, or would no longer like to be a sponsor, please do not hesitate to contact us. We can be reached by phone at 031 552 21 25 or by e-mail at: info@compassion.ch\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    With this letter, we acknowledge that you would not like to sponsor another child at this time.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Did you know that you can also help children in poverty by giving them access to clean water (water filters, toilet installation, hygiene awareness)? If you are interested, call us on 031 552 21 25 or donate online here at www.compassion.ch/spenden.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"We are thankful to work with you and so many other sponsors and donors to help release children from poverty every day.\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Sincerely,\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.sudo().user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"nb_weeks\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 7\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"nb_years\" t-value=\"(sponsorships[:1].contract_duration // 364) or 1\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"field\" t-value=\"child[:1].field_office_id\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"field.fcp_hours_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"meals\" t-value=\"field.fcp_meal_week * nb_weeks\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"medical\" t-value=\"field.fcp_medical_check * nb_years\"/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"len(str(hours_fcp)) &gt; 3\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"str((hours_fcp))\"/>\n"
"            <t t-set=\"hours_fcp\" t-value=\"hours_fcp[:-3] + &#x27;.&#x27; + hours_fcp[-3:]\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your children&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;lui&#x27;) == &#x27;lui&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"one\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;) and child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"sub\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;sub_sponsorship_id.child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"last_letter\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].child_letter_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&#x27;voi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;te&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&#x27;voi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tu&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"possa\" t-value=\"&#x27;possiate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;possa&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"hai\" t-value=\"&#x27;avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hai&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"number_deaths_under_5\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_deaths_under_5&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"age_deaths_under_5\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;age_deaths_under_5&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Siamo felici di informar<t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> che dopo tanti anni, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> è <t t-out=\"&#x27;arrivato&#x27; if boy else &#x27;arrivata&#x27;\"></t> alla fine del sostegno con successo.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <b>\n"
"            Da giovane <t t-out=\"&#x27;adulto&#x27; if boy else &#x27;donna&#x27;\"></t> è ora una persona responsabile, pronta ad affrontare la vita con speranza e fiducia. Non è meraviglioso?\n"
"        </b>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Durante il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> ha trascorso <t t-out=\"hours_fcp\"></t> ore presso il centro di sviluppo infantile della chiesa locale. Il personale si è preso cura di <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t> con amore, trasmettendo<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> speranza per il futuro. Ha ricevuto <t t-out=\"meals\"></t> pasti e beneficiato di <t t-out=\"medical\"></t> visite mediche.\n"
"        <t t-if=\"child[:1].age &gt;= 7\">\n"
"            Ha potuto inoltre frequentare la scuola ed essere incoraggiat<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> a sviluppare i propri talenti. Infine, ha scoperto che qualcuno dall'altra parte del mondo si preoccupava per <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t>. Grazie di cuore!\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"2 in last_letter.communication_type_ids.ids and not last_letter.sent_date\">\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                È per noi un momento emozionante, <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> inviamo in allegato la sua ultima lettera.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"hai.title()\"></t> l'opportunità di scriver<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> un'ultima lettera per salutar<t t-out=\"&#x27;lo&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> e incoraggiarl<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> per il futuro.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie per aver contribuito a un cambiamento duraturo nella vita di <t t-out=\"&#x27;un bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;una bambina&#x27;\"></t> e della sua famiglia.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Il nostro impegno contro la povertà estrema continua, <t t-out=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\"></t> milioni di bambini vivono ancora in condizioni inaccettabili. Ogni giorno, muoiono <t t-out=\"number_deaths_under_5\"></t> bambini sotto i <t t-out=\"age_deaths_under_5\"></t> anni. Non possiamo restare inerti di fronte a questa ingiustizia, per questo motivo ci permettiamo di propor<t t-out=\"ti\"></t> a breve un nuovo sostegno.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Insieme, stiamo contribuendo a cambiare il mondo, un bambino alla volta.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Cari saluti,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_child_notes
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;many children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   The living situation of your sponsored child has changed. The staff at the the Child Development Center has informed us that <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;note_ids.body&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support for a child in extreme poverty is valuable. At Compassion, we believe that this will give a child the opportunity to live a dignified and meaningful life. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together we can positively transform the lives of currently more than 2 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  Kind regards,\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"       <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    PS: As you requested, we will send you the original letter<t t-out=\"s\"></t>. Please keep in mind it can take several weeks until we receive it.\n"
"</t>\n"
" </p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;many children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie di cuore per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> tramite il sostegno.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In un contesto di estrema povertà, a volte le situazioni di vita possono cambiare rapidamente. Questo è ciò che è successo a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, il centro di sviluppo infantile in cui è iscritt<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> ci informa che <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;note_ids.body&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Più di <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza ci permettono di affermare che un sostegno può cambiare non solo la vita di un bambino, ma anche quella della sua famiglia.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> impegno al nostro fianco.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_completion_date_change
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We learned that <t t-out=\"child.firstname\"></t> will finish the Compassion program on <t t-out=\"child.get_date(&#x27;completion_date&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Abbiamo appreso che <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name or child.firstname\"></t> terminerà il programma di sostegno il <t t-out=\"child.get_date(&#x27;completion_date&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"                </p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_sponsorship_transfer_dossier
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"len(child) &lt; 4\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"correspondant\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_term\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id.name&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_term or &#x27;Postfinance&#x27; in payment_term\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    A very warm welcome to you, <t t-out=\"partner.firstname\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    It's so nice to have you as part of the Compassion Switzerland family!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Together with you and <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> partner churches in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries, we are currently releasing over <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> million children from poverty. Collectively, we enable the children to have a life with a future filled with hope.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    In order to ensure a smooth continuation to your sponsorship for <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, please find attached important information:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;\">\n"
"    <li>1 photo of <t t-out=\"&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;each child&#x27;\"></t></li>\n"
"    <li>1 folder with important information about your sponsorship</li>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"        <li>1 sheet of labels for the letter correspondence (please stick them on cards, letters, stickers, drawings, etc.)</li>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"            We kindly ask you to fill in and return via post the attached bank form to continue your sponsorship journey with <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            We kindly ask you to activate a standing order with the attached payment slip to continue your sponsorship journey with <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Please do not hesitate to get in touch with us if you have any further questions.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Thank you so much for investing in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;life of &#x27; + firstname if less_4 else &#x27;lives of many children&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    We wish you much joy as you continue your sponsorship journey.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Together, we are changing the world! One child at a time.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&quot;child_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"one_child\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"girl\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&quot;preferred_name&quot;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_term\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id.name&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_term or &#x27;Postfinance&#x27; in payment_term\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per aver deciso di far parte della famiglia di Compassion in Svizzera!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Insieme a <t t-out=\"te\"></t> e a oltre <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner nel Sud del mondo, stiamo liberando <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini dalla povertà estrema. Stiamo offrendo loro un futuro di speranza.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Per <t t-out=\"&#x27;assicurarvi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;assicurarti&#x27;\"></t> che il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno continui nelle migliori condizioni possibili, <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> alleghiamo una serie di documenti e informazioni importanti:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 foto di <t t-out=\"firstname if one_child else &#x27;di ciascun bambino&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 file con informazioni pratiche sul <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 foglio con le etichette da utilizzare per la corrispondenza con <t t-out=\"firstname if one_child else &#x27;i bambini&#x27;\"></t> (da incollare su biglietti, lettere, disegni, adesivi, ecc.)\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"        Per continuare a sostenerl<t t-out=\"&#x27;i&#x27; if not one_child else (&#x27;a&#x27; if girl else &#x27;o&#x27;)\"></t>, <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> preghiamo di compilare il modulo allegato e rispedircelo firmato per posta.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Per continuare a sostenerl<t t-out=\"&#x27;i&#x27; if not one_child else (&#x27;a&#x27; if girl else &#x27;o&#x27;)\"></t>, <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> preghiamo di impostare il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> ordine permanente utilizzando il bollettino di versamento allegato.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie di cuore per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, <t t-out=\"ti.capitalize()\"></t> auguriamo tanta gioia nella relazione con <t t-out=\"&#x27;loro&#x27; if not one_child else (&#x27;lei&#x27; if girl else &#x27;lui&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Per qualsiasi domanda, non <t t-out=\"&#x27;esitate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esitare&#x27;\"></t> a contattarci.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Insieme, contribuiamo a cambiare il mondo, un bambino alla volta.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top: 20px\">\n"
"    PS: <t t-out=\"&#x27;Sapevate che potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Sapevi che puoi&#x27;\"></t> scrivere <t t-out=\"&#x27;ai bambini&#x27; if not one_child else (&#x27;alla bambina&#x27; if girl else &#x27;al bambino&#x27;)\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t> in modo facile e veloce su <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/it\">MyCompassion</a>? La piattaforma <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> permette di avere sempre con <t t-out=\"te\"></t> tutte le informazioni, le foto e le lettere di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.b2s_email_not_read
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letter\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"s\" t-value=\"&#x27;&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;s&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner_name\" t-value=\"partner.firstname and (partner.firstname + &#x27; &#x27; + partner.lastname) or partner.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"email\" t-value=\"partner.email\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    A few days ago, you should have received a letter by email from <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Unfortunately, it does not seem to have been delivered to the email address <t t-out=\"email\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    That is why we are sending you the letter by post. We hope you enjoy it!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Has your email changed? Or maybe the email landed in your spam folder?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Please let us know if you have a new email address or kindly add info@compassion.ch to your contacts to ensure that the email does not land in the spam folder.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"years_uc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> years of experience has shown us that letters have a decisive influence on the children’s development.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for taking a few minutes of your time to respond to the letter online in your <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion profile</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letter\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;vostri figlioli&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_fund_2022\" t-value=\"265 in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Pochi giorni fa le abbiamo inviato una lettera di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>! Ha avuto il tempo di leggerla?\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Lo scambio di lettere è un elemento chiave per il sostegno di un bambino. <t t-out=\"years_uc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza dimostrano che le lettere danno un contributo decisivo allo sviluppo del bambino.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Ci auguriamo che le faccia piacere leggere le notizie <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;del suo bambino&#x27;)\"></t>. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Grazie in anticipo per prendere qualche minuto per rispondere alla letterina. Grazie di usare parole di incoraggiamento per <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. Può scrivere  direttamente dal nostro sito internet: https://compassion.ch/it/scrivere/  o tramite l'App di Compassion https://compassion.ch/app/\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Se preferisce che un volontario scriva a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> per conto suo, ci contatti gentilmente al numero +41 031 552 21 24 o per email a: courrier@compassion.ch\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Restiamo a sua completa disposizione per qualsiasi domanda relativa agli scambi di corrispondenza!\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Ancora una volta le ricordiamo che sta trasformando la vita di un bambino liberandolo dalla povertà estrema dandogli la possibilità di una vita dignitosa e piena di significato.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Riceva i nostri calorosi saluti\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_caregiver_change
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"caregiver\" t-value=\"child.household_id.primary_caregiver\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We learned that the primary caregiver of <t t-out=\"child.firstname\"></t> is now <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"&#x27;Beneficiary&#x27; not in caregiver\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"caregiver\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"&#x27;sister&#x27; if &#x27;Female&#x27; in caregiver else &#x27;brother&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    .\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"gender\" t-value=\"child.household_id.primary_caregiver_id.gender\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"caregiver\" t-value=\"child.household_id.primary_caregiver\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Abbiamo appreso che la persona che si occupa di <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name or child.firstname\"></t> è ora \n"
"                    <t t-if=\"&#x27;Beneficiary&#x27; not in caregiver\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"&#x27;suo&#x27; if gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;sua&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"caregiver\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"&#x27;sua sorella&#x27; if &#x27;Female&#x27; in caregiver else &#x27;suo fratello&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    .\n"
"                </p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_project_reactivation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"project\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"reactivation\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[0]\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"details\" t-value=\"reactivation.icp_improvement_desc\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    A few time ago the project <t t-out=\"project.icp_id\"></t> where <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;is&#x27;)\"></t> registered was on suspension.\n"
"                    We are happy to inform you that the problem is resolved and that the project is again sane and active.\n"
"                    The project will do regular tuitions and spiritual activites to keep the situation healthy.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"details\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"details\"></t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    Yours sincerely\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"project\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reactivation\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"details\" t-value=\"reactivation.fcp_improvement_desc\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Siamo stati avvisati che il Centro <t t-out=\"project.fcp_id\"></t>, dove <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;is&#x27;)\"></t> iscritt<t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;accord_o_a&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;firstname&#x27;, 3, &#x27;vostri figlioli&#x27;)\"></t>, è stato riattivato. Se il vostro pagamento era stato interrotto, potrà da oggi riattivarlo.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"details\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"details\"></t>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    Per qualsiasi richiesta di informazioni non esitate a contattarci. \n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Vi ringraziamo per la vostra fiducia nei confronti di Compassion.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Fraterni saluti.\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_project_transition
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"project\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"transition\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[0]\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"details\" t-value=\"transition.details\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    A few time ago the project <t t-out=\"project.icp_id\"></t> where <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;is&#x27;)\"></t> registered was on suspension.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Unfortunately the local church will definitely end its partnership with Compassion\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"transition.transition_date\">\n"
"                        <!-- --> on <t t-out=\"transition.get_date(&#x27;transition date&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"transition.transition_reason_ids\">\n"
"                        <!-- --> because of <t t-out=\"transition.get_list(&#x27;transition_reason_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    .\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"transition.future_involvement_ids\">\n"
"                        The project will continue to work and offer <t t-out=\"transition.get_list(&#x27;future_involvement_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t> in its area.\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"details\">\n"
"                        <span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><t t-out=\"details\"></t></span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"transition.action_plan\">\n"
"                        <span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><t t-out=\"transition.action_plan\"></t></span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    The children living close to another project will be transfered.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We feel sorry for this situation and hope you will understand. You will receive soon another letter that will give you more details about <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t>. Thank you so much for the support.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Please don't hesitate to contact us in case you have any questions regarding the situation.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Yours sincerely\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;vostri figlioli&#x27;) or child.get_list(&#x27;firstname&#x27;, 3, &#x27;vostri figlioli&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"project\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"transition\" t-value=\"project.lifecycle_ids[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"details\" t-value=\"transition.details\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Recentemente vi abbiamo avvisato della sospensione del Centro di Compassion <t t-out=\"project.fcp_id\"></t>, dove <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;is&#x27;)\"></t> iscritt<t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;accord_o_a&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Purtroppo siamo stati informati che la chiesa locale terminerà definitivamente le sue attività come Centro di Compassion\n"
"    <t t-if=\"transition.transition_reason_ids\">\n"
"        , da <t t-out=\"transition.get_list(&#x27;transition_reason_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    .\n"
"    <t t-if=\"transition.future_involvement_ids\">\n"
"        <span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><t t-out=\"transition.get_list(&#x27;future_involvement_ids.value&#x27;)\"></t></span>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"details\">\n"
"        <span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><t t-out=\"details\"></t></span>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"transition.action_plan\">\n"
"        <span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><t t-out=\"transition.action_plan\"></t></span>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    I bambini che vivono vicino a un altro Centro di Compassion saranno trasferiti.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Siamo desolati di questa situazione. Presto riceverete una lettera che vi informerà della conclusione dell’adozione a distanza. Permetteteci di ringraziarvi di cuore per il vostro sostegno a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> durante tutto questo tempo.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Per qualsiasi richiesta di informazioni non esitate a contattarci per telefono, lettera o e-mail.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Fraterni saluti.\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_child_transition
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Dear sponsor,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We warmly thank you for your precious sponsorship of <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Your sponsored child is starting now the <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;cdsp_type&#x27;)\"></t> sponsorship program.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We encourage you to send a letter to your child to encourage him participating to the program.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Yours sincerely\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Vi ringraziamo calorosamente per il vostro sostegno a <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name or child.firstname\"></t> ha appena iniziato il sostegno, vi invitiamo a scrivere presto una lettera in modo da <t t-out=\"&#x27;incoraggiarlo&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;incoraggiarla&#x27;\"></t> a partetfcpare attivamente.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Fraterni saluti\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_hold_removal
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"hold\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"owner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id.firstname\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child_code\" t-value=\"hold.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;local_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child_name\" t-value=\"hold.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;name&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Dear <t t-out=\"owner\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    We just learned that the child <t t-out=\"child_name\"></t> with ref. <t t-out=\"child_code\"></t> is no longer available for sponsorship.\n"
"                    The following comments were received :\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"hold\" t-as=\"h\">\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"h.comments\"></t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    If you have the childpack, please don't use it.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Yours sincerely\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hold\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"owner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"hold.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child_code\" t-value=\"hold.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;local_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child_name\" t-value=\"hold.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;name&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"owner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Abbiamo appreso che <t t-out=\"child_name\"></t>, <t t-out=\"child_code\"></t>. Non è più disponibile per essere <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenuto&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;sostenuta&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Abbiamo ricevuto il messaggio seguente (in inglese):\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <i><t t-out=\"hold.comments\"></t></i>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Se avete ancora con voi il dossier del <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;child&#x27;)\"></t>, vi preghiamo di non utilizzarlo.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Cordiali saluti.\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_child_transfer
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"preferred_name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fcp\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;lifecycle_ids&#x27;)[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"preferred_name\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We have received a message that your sponsored child has moved to a new Child Development Centre.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Therefore, <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> has been issued a new reference number, <t t-out=\"child.local_id\"></t>, which you will need for future letter correspondences via post.\n"
"</p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"partner.email\">\n"
"    \t<p>You can write via your <a href=\"https://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a> profile.</p>\n"
"    \t<p>Do you need inspiration? <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/was-soll-ich-meinem-patenkind-schreiben/\">5 ideas to write your letter</a></p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"object.send_mode == &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"    \t<p>Enclosed, you will find a new sheet of labels for your letters that you send via post.</p>\n"
"    \t<p>You can also write via your <a href=\"https://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a> profile.</p>\n"
"    \t<p>Do you need inspiration? <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/was-soll-ich-meinem-patenkind-schreiben/\">5 ideas to write your letter</a></p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We wish you much joy whilst writing!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"\t<p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t></p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fcp\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;project_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lifecycle\" t-value=\"child.lifecycle_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie di cuore per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"name\"></t> attraverso il sostegno. <t t-out=\"&#x27;State&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Stai&#x27;\"></t> facendo una differenza duratura nella sua vita.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Abbiamo ricevuto la notizia che <t t-out=\"name\"></t> ha cambiato centro di accoglienza e che il suo nuovo numero di riferimento è il seguente: <t t-out=\"child.local_id\"></t>.\n"
"<!--\n"
"Abbiamo ricevuto la notizia che <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;il suo bambino&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;is&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;stato trasferito&#x27;)\"></t> in un altro centro Compassion, causa trasferimento. Di conseguenza,\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"one\">\n"
"    ha un nuovo numero di riferimento: <t t-out=\"child.local_id\"></t>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    hanno dei nuovi numeri di riferimento:\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"child\" t-as=\"_child\">\n"
"            <li>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"_child.preferred_name\"></t> : <t t-out=\"_child.local_id\"></t>\n"
"            </li>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"-->\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> preghiamo, d’ora in poi, di utilizzare questo riferimento quando <t t-out=\"&#x27;le&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;gli&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;scriverete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;scriverai&#x27;\"></t> una lettera.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not partner.email\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        In allegato <t t-out=\"&#x27;troverete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;troverai&#x27;\"></t> un set di etichette da incollare alle lettere che <t t-out=\"&#x27;invierete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;invierai&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Puoi&#x27;\"></t> anche scrivere <a href=\"https://www.compassion.ch/ecrire\">online</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Se <t t-out=\"&#x27;avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hai&#x27;\"></t> bisogno di ispirazione, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> trovare alcune idee qui: <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/cosa-dovrei-scrivere-al-mio-bambino/\">compassion.ch/it/cosa-dovrei-scrivere-al-mio-bambino</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Buona scrittura!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.new_letter
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letter\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"s\" t-value=\"&#x27;&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;s&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner_name\" t-value=\"partner.firstname and (partner.firstname + &#x27; &#x27; + partner.lastname) or partner.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"urls\" t-value=\"[]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"letter.filtered(&#x27;read_url&#x27;).mapped(&#x27;read_url&#x27;)\" t-as=\"letter_set\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"letter_set not in urls\">\n"
"             <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"urls.append(letter_set)\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field_office_ids\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;).ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"restricted\" t-value=\"1 in field_office_ids or 19 in field_office_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We are very happy to inform you that a new letter has arrived from <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number()) or child.get_list(&#x27;firstname&#x27;, 3, child.get_number())\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You can download the letter by clicking on the link. Enjoy reading:\n"
"    </p><ul>\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"urls\" t-as=\"l\">\n"
"            <li>\n"
"                <a t-attf-href=\"{{l}}\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"l\"></t>\n"
"                </a>\n"
"            </li>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"years_uc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> years of experience show us the importance of letters for the development of the children.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you in advance for taking a few minutes to reply to the enclosed letter. You can respond online via <a href=\"https://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"restricted\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Important information about writing to your sponsored <t t-out=\"&#x27;child&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;children&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/BD_SL_child_communication_de.pdf\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Information on writing letters\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Please do not hesitate to contact us with regards to any questions you may have in relation to exchanging letters.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Best regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letter\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"al_bambino\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;al bambino&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;vostri figlioli&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner_name\" t-value=\"partner.firstname and (partner.firstname + &#x27; &#x27; + partner.lastname) or partner.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"urls\" t-value=\"[]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"letter.filtered(&#x27;read_url&#x27;).mapped(&#x27;read_url&#x27;)\" t-as=\"letter_set\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"letter_set not in urls\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"urls.append(letter_set)\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field_office_ids\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;).ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"restricted\" t-value=\"1 in field_office_ids or 19 in field_office_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_fund_2022\" t-value=\"265 in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_IT_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_IT_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_IT_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_IT_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Siamo felici di <t t-out=\"&#x27;inviarvi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;inviarti&#x27;\"></t> una nuova lettera di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Cliccate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Clicca&#x27;\"></t> sul link per scaricarla.* Buona lettura.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"urls\" t-as=\"l\">\n"
"            <li>\n"
"                <a t-attf-href=\"{{l}}\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"l\"></t>\n"
"                </a>\n"
"            </li>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Oltre <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza hanno dimostrato che lo scambio di lettere può avere un'influenza significativa sullo sviluppo del bambino sostenuto.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Puoi&#x27;\"></t> scrivere <t t-out=\"al_bambino\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t> in modo semplice e veloce su <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a>. La piattaforma <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> permette di avere sempre a portata di mano foto, lettere e informazioni su <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Se <t t-out=\"&#x27;avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hai&#x27;\"></t> domande sulla corrispondenza, non <t t-out=\"&#x27;esitate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esitare&#x27;\"></t> a contattarci!\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"restricted\">\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Qui <t t-out=\"&#x27;troverete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;troverai&#x27;\"></t> raccomandazioni speciali per la corrispondenza con <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>:\n"
"            </p><div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"                <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/BD_SL_child_communication_fr.pdf\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"                    Vedi le raccomandazioni speciali\n"
"                </a>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        \n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.sudo().short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    *Se <t t-out=\"&#x27;avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hai&#x27;\"></t> problemi a scaricare la lettera, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> aprirla su <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.mail_onboarding_first_letter
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letter\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"letter.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"len(child) &lt; 4\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deinem_patenkind\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"apos\" t-value=\"&quot;&#x27;&quot; if firstname[-1] == &#x27;s&#x27; else &quot;&#x27;s&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"urls\" t-value=\"[]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"special\" t-value=\"&quot;BD&quot; in child.get_list(&quot;local_id&quot;) or &quot;LK&quot; in child.get_list(&quot;local_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"letter.filtered(&#x27;read_url&#x27;).mapped(&#x27;read_url&#x27;)\" t-as=\"letter_set\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"letter_set not in urls\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"urls.append(letter_set)\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(urls) == 0\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"urls.append(&#x27;https://mycompassion.ch/my/children?child_id=&#x27; + str(letter.child_id.id))\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>We are excited to send you <t t-out=\"firstname + apos\"></t> first letter today.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(letter) == 1\">\n"
"        <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"            <a t-attf-href=\"{{urls[0]}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"                Download letter\n"
"            </a>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <p>You can download the letters here:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <t t-foreach=\"urls\" t-as=\"the_url\">\n"
"            <li><a t-attf-href=\"{{the_url}}\">Letter from <t t-out=\"letter[loop.index0].child_id.preferred_name\"></t></a></li>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>It's important to know that the sponsored children live in a culture where communication is predominantly verbal. Writing letters and responding to specific questions is, therefore, a long learning process. It's so nice that you're accompanying <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> in that!</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The first letter was written before the sponsorship began, and every letter travels a long way:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/chemin_en.pdf\">\n"
"            <img src=\"http://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/image_1_letter_en.png\"/>\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>You can reply to <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> via <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/en_US/my/letter\">MyCompassion</a>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not letter.mapped(&#x27;sponsorship_id&#x27;).filtered(&#x27;is_first_sponsorship&#x27;)\">\n"
"    <t t-if=\"special\">\n"
"        <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"            <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/BD_SL_child_communication_EN.pdf\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"                Extra information for writing letters to your sponsored child<t t-out=\"&#x27;ren&#x27; if one_child\"></t>.\n"
"            </a>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>Another important letter writing information: To ensure the protection of the children, but also for your own safety, the communication between you and your sponsored child[ren] must run solely through us.</p>\n"
"<p>Please never mention:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Your postal address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your email address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your phone number</li>\n"
"    <li>Compassion Switzerland's address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your Facebook or other social media contact details</li>\n"
"    <li>Making promises (e.g. a gift or visit)</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>It is so wonderful that you are investing in the <t t-out=\"&quot;life of &quot; + firstname if one_child else (&quot;lives of &quot; + firstname if less_4 else &quot;your sponsored children&quot;)\"></t>!</p>\n"
"<p>Warm regards,</p>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.sudo().signature\"></t></p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_biennial
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;many children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"Hasnot\" t-value=\"&quot;Hasn&#x27;t&quot;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"Hasnot\" t-value=\"&quot;Haven&#x27;t&quot;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We're excited to send you a new photo of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. <t t-out=\"Hasnot\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> grown a lot?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Why not take some time to write a letter to <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> and show <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> how precious <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> is? You can do so <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/schreiben/\">online</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thanks to your generous and faithful support, the employees of the child centre can care for <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> in a holistic way. In the context of activities, a great emphasis is placed not only on <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> academic advancement, but also on <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> personality development. <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> has access to medical care, receives balanced meals and is learning personal responsibility.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Together, we are changing the world! One child at a time.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"male\" t-value=\"partner.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;sms&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Hai ricevuto una nuova foto di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> su MyCompassion. Com’è cambiat<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t>, vero?\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Prenditi un momento per scriver<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> quanto sei orgoglios<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> di <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. È qualcosa di molto prezioso!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Buona giornata.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        È con gioia che <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> inviamo in allegato una nuova foto di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, così <t t-out=\"&#x27;potrete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;potrai&#x27;\"></t> vedere come è cresciut<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> invitiamo a prendere qualche minuto per scrivere a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> quanto <t t-out=\"&#x27;siete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sei&#x27;\"></t> orgoglios<t t-out=\"&#x27;i&#x27; if plural else (&#x27;o&#x27; if male else &#x27;a&#x27;)\"></t> di <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potrete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;potrai&#x27;\"></t> farlo direttamente online:\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &quot;physical&quot;\">\n"
"            <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/scrivere/\">\n"
"                compassion.ch/it/scrivere.\n"
"            </a>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            compassion.ch/it/scrivere.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie al <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> generoso e fedele impegno, i collaboratori del centro di sviluppo infantile possono fornire un sostegno olistico <t t-out=\"&#x27;al bambino&#x27; if boy else &#x27;alla bambina&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t>. <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> non solo frequenta la scuola, ma riceve anche buoni pasti e assistenza medica. È incoraggiat<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> e stimolat<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> a sviluppare i propri talenti, la propria personalità e a coltivare la speranza.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Insieme, contribuiamo a cambiare il mondo, un bambino alla volta.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Cari saluti e a presto,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</t></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_sponsorship_dossier
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"his\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"he\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"him\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"correspondant\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id&#x27;) or len(object.partner_id.sponsorship_ids) != len(sponsorships)\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Thank you for committing to support another child through Compassion Switzerland.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        A warm welcome to you, <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation|replace(&#x27;Dear&#x27;, &#x27;dear&#x27;)\"></t>! It's so nice to have you as part of the Compassion family!\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Your support will change the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family significantly. We thank you so much\n"
"    for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> and encouraging [him] through your letters and prayers.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    For a smooth start of this new relationship please find enclosed:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 photo of <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 folder with practical information about your sponsorship\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 sheet of labels to use for all the correspondence with <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> (to stick on your\n"
"        cards, letters, stickers, etc.).\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"sponsorships[0].payment_type_attachment\"></t>\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 presentation card to send to <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Upon receipt of the first payment, which we are expecting in the coming days, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> will be notified that you are <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> sponsor.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for your valuable involvement in our sponsorship program. We hope that the relationship with <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> will be a source of joy and blessing for him as well as for you!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.sudo().user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    PS: Do you already have the Compassion App? With it you always have your sponsored child's pictures, letters and all\n"
"    information at hand. And the letter writing is made even easier. Download here: www.compassion.ch/app\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"many_children\" t-value=\"len(child) &gt; 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_term\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id.name&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_term or &#x27;Postfinance&#x27; in payment_term\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"correspondant\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;correspondent_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"is_new\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        Grazie per <t t-out=\"&#x27;esservi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esserti&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;uniti&#x27; if plural else (&#x27;unita&#x27; if partner.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;unito&#x27;)\"></t> alla famiglia di Compassion.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Grazie per aver deciso di investire nel migliorare la vita di uno o più bambini.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Insieme a <t t-out=\"&#x27;voi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;te&#x27;\"></t> e a oltre <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner nel Sud del mondo, stiamo liberando <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini dalla povertà estrema. Stiamo offrendo loro un futuro di speranza.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Per iniziare bene il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno, <t t-out=\"&#x27;troverete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;troverai&#x27;\"></t> in allegato una serie di documenti e informazioni importanti:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Una foto <t t-out=\"&#x27;dei bambini&#x27; if many_children else (&#x27;della bambina&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;del bambino&#x27;)\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Informazioni pratiche sul <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Uno o più biglietti di presentazione da inviare <t t-out=\"&#x27;ai bambini&#x27; if many_children else (&#x27;alla bambina&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;al bambino&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Un foglio con le etichette da utilizzare per la corrispondenza (da incollare su biglietti, lettere, disegni, adesivi, ecc.), che indicheranno il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> riferimento come <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenitori&#x27; if plural else (&#x27;sostenitrice&#x27; if partner.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;sostenitore&#x27;)\"></t> e il riferimento <t t-out=\"&#x27;dei bambini&#x27; if many_children else (&#x27;della bambina&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;del bambino&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"        Per confermare il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno <t t-out=\"&#x27;ai bambini&#x27; if len(child) &gt; 3 else &#x27;a &#x27; + firstname\"></t>, <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> preghiamo di compilare il modulo LSV allegato e rispedircelo per posta in modo da attivare l'addebito diretto del <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> contributo mensile.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"         Per confermare il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno <t t-out=\"&#x27;ai bambini&#x27; if len(child) &gt; 3 else &#x27;a &#x27; + firstname\"></t>, <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> preghiamo di impostare il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> ordine permanente utilizzando il bollettino allegato.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Al ricevimento del primo pagamento, <t t-out=\"&#x27;i bambini&#x27; if len(child) &gt; 3 else firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;verranno&#x27; if many_children else &#x27;verrà&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;informati&#x27; if len(child) &gt; 1 else (&#x27;informata&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;informato&#x27;)\"></t> del <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie a <t t-out=\"te\"></t>, non solo un bambino, ma un'intera famiglia potrà guardare al futuro con più fiducia. Grazie per aver preso questa generosa decisione a favore di <t t-out=\"&#x27;questi bambini&#x27; if len(child) &gt; 3 else firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"ti.capitalize()\"></t> auguriamo tanta gioia nel sostenerl<t t-out=\"&#x27;i&#x27; if len(child) &gt; 1 else (&#x27;a&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;o&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Per qualsiasi domanda, non <t t-out=\"&#x27;esitate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esitare&#x27;\"></t> a contattarci.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Insieme, contribuiamo a cambiare il mondo, un bambino alla volta.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_child_reinstatement
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We have received good news! <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t><t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;)\"></t> has returned to the project of the local church and has been re-enrolled in the sponsorship program, because <t t-out=\"child.lifecycle_ids[:1].translate(&#x27;request_reason&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   You were previously the sponsor of <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;)\"></t>. Thus we would like to offer you the opportunity to sponsor <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;)\"></t> again and continue to invest in <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> life in order to release <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> from poverty in the long-term. We thank you in advance for a quick answer.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   After more than 70 years of experience, we at Compassion believe: Taking on a sponsorship changes the life of a child, their family and their surroundings. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together with you and our 8600 partner churches in the global south, we are able to transform the lives of more than 2,3 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Kind Regards,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;siete stati i suoi sostenitori, vi&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"partner.gender == &#x27;F&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;sei stata la sua sostenitrice, ti&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;sei stato il suo sostenitore, ti&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Buone notizie! <t t-out=\"&#x27;La bambina&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;Il bambino&#x27;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&#x27;sostenete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sostieni&#x27;\"></t> è tornat<t t-out=\"&#x27;a&#x27; if child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;o&#x27;\"></t> al centro di sviluppo infantile di Compassion, reintegrandosi nel programma di sviluppo.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Poiché <t t-out=\"phrase\"></t> daremo la priorità nel caso <t t-out=\"&#x27;vogliate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tu voglia&#x27;\"></t> riprendere il suo sostegno per aiutarl<t t-out=\"&#x27;o&#x27; if boy else &#x27;a&#x27;\"></t> a uscire definitivamente dalla povertà.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> ringraziamo in anticipo per un’eventuale <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostra&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tua&#x27;\"></t> conferma.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Immaginate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Immagina&#x27;\"></t> quanto sarebbe felice <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> se ricevesse questa notizia!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Più di <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza ci permettono di affermare che il sostegno non solo può fare una differenza duratura nella vita di un bambino, ma anche della sua famiglia e di coloro che gli sono vicini.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> impegno nella lotta contro la povertà estrema!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_illness
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"\n"
"    Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    In Switzerland and also in the country where <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>     lives, healthcare problems sometimes occurdespite medical care and support. Our staff at the Children‘s Center haveinformed us that <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> has <t t-out=\"child.current_values\"></t>. It is a chronic illness.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Thanks to your regular support and through a special fund for medical emergencies, Compassion is committed to the treatment and care of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>. If you accompany <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> in prayer now and ask for God‘s blessings andprotection, you are taking on an important service for this child!\n"
"      <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Your support of a child in extreme poverty is valuable. At Compassion, weare convinced that this will give a child the chance for a dignified and meaningfullife. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"     <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Thank you again for your committment, so that together we can positivelytransform the lives of currently more than 2 million children in 25countries.\n"
"     <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Best regards,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"      <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Grazie di cuore di investire nella vita di <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name or child.firstname\"></t> attraverso il sostegno a distanza.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   In Svizzera, come nel paese in cui vive <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name or child.firstname\"></t>, succede che nonostante il monitoraggio e il supporto medico, si verifichino problemi di salute. Siamo stati informati dal centro che frequenta <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name or child.firstname\"></t>, che <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;lui&#x27;)\"></t> ha <t t-out=\"child.current_values\"></t>. Si tratta di una malattia cronica.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Grazie al suo sostegno e al fondo medico speciale. Compassion si impegna a seguire e a trattare i problemi di salute di <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name or child.firstname\"></t>. Grazie di pregare per la sua salute.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Il suo sostegno per un bambino che vive in condizioni di estrema povertà è prezioso. A Compassion crediamo che sta offrendo a sing. un bambino una vita dignitosa e piena di significato. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Ancora una volta grazie per il suo impegno al nostro fianco, che ci permette di cambiare la vita di oltre 2 milioni di bambini in 27 paesi.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Riceva i nostri calorosi saluti.\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"      <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_compassion
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_compassion.email_planned_exit_notification
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&quot;child_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"We have good news!  <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"></t> is coming to the end of the sponsorship journey after <t t-out=\"(datetime.datetime.now() -sponsorships[:1].start_date).days // 364\"></t> years of support from you and the staff in the field.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"That's a reason to celebrate and be thankful!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You will receive more information about the end of the sponsorship in the coming weeks.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Thank you so much for your investment in the life of  <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"See you soon.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

